      "id": 19254,
      "name": "Paul",
      "username": "Paul",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-06-11T16:21:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I really apologize for missing May! Back in April I mentioned that I was coming up on the busiest travel time of the month, and that really did me in! The update list below will involve a bunch of notes about that :)</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">We completed our purchase of the Cheapass Games product line!! I am so excited about this!! I'm planning on doing a separate post just about that, either later today or later this week.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">We completed funding for the Cheapass Games in Black &amp; White book, and it succeeded beyond my expectations. I'm really thrilled to have another group of such enthusiastic fans to interact with :)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Jenn, SaRae, Sarah, and I all visited China and toured a number of factories, including the factories where they make all of the Sentinels of the Multiverse and Spirit Island stuff.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Maggie, Christopher, and I visited Alliance Game Distribution and GTM (Game Trade Media) in Baltimore. While there, we filmed playthroughs of <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bRF8z-FEpI4\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Homebrewers</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w2qvNOfDdx4\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Medium</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HLCs2Qilkzw\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Sentinel Comics: RPG</a>! Maggie even created the ideal character for me to cosplay :D</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Maggie, Twuana, Sarah, and I visited ACD Distribution in Madison for ACD Games Day, their annual retailer summit.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Christopher, Maggie, Matt, Katie, and I visited the UK to attend UK Games Expo. We were a sponsor again, and it was our best one yet, both in terms of booth presence and in terms of sales and demo attendance.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">While in Europe for UKGE, Maggie and I also attended the Asmodee UK retailer summit in Birmingham, and the Asmodee Nordics retailer summit in Copenhagen.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Meanwhile, back at HQ, we dealt with some frustrating production delays from several factories that impacted both Homebrewers and Medium. Fortunately, those seem resolved.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">We did a lot of editing and pre-press work on our two most time-consuming in-progress projects, Legends of Sleepy Hollow and Sentinel Comics: RPG core rule book. Both now seem on track to actually start mass production some time this summer.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">We did a massive amount of Gen Con planning and work, including acquiring all new booth fixtures and creating a detailed schedule.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">If you are at all interested in attending Gen Con without having to buy a badge, and getting paid $15/hour to demo games, send me an email (paul@greaterthangames.com)!</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">The warehouse received a massive amount of pre-Gen Con inventory for other publishers via GTG Operations.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">The warehouse received a massive amount of Cheapass Games inventory.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Jodie spent a ton of time driving trucks back and forth among our several warehouse location in the St. Louis area.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">We put more work into our new building plans. I just want that to be *done* at this point.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">We did a fair amount of work on several unannounced upcoming business deals/projects that may or may not develop into something.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">We got a ton of new art in for Spirit Island: Jagged Earth and Sentinel Comics: RPG</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">We celebrated the 1 year anniversaries of Twuana, Sarah, and Chris Burton!</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Here is the status of all of our works in progress.</p>\n<p><strong>In Stock Since March</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Nothing</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Shipping to Backers</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Nothing</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>In Transit; On a Boat</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Nothing</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>At Factory; Pre-Press Work</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\"><em>Legends of Sleepy Hollow</em></li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\"><em>Homebrewers</em></li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\"><em>Microbrewers</em></li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\"><em>Medium</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Current WIP Focus by GTG</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Sentinel Comics: The Role Playing Game core rulebook (Christopher, Jenn, Critical Hits)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Prime War (Christopher, Chris Burton, Lore Forge)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Spirit Island: The Jagged Earth (Paul, Christopher, Jenn, Erik)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Sentinels of Freedom video game (Christopher, Adam, Underbite Studio)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">The History of Sentinel Comics (Christopher, Adam)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Untitled Cheapass Games Project (Jenn, Chris Burton, James Ernest)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Milkman (Chris Kirkman, Chris Burton)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Fate of the Elder Gods: Agents of Arkham (Chris Kirkman)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Some other games (Chris Kirkman, Chris Burton)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">A new and improved website (Jenn, Paul, Alex, Joel)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>I'll see you next month!</p>",
