      "created_at": "2019-06-20T22:07:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>@Cult of Gloom</p>\n<p>The factory visit was great! I could definitely answer any specific questions you have. In general, I think that seeing the processes for production is very helpful when it comes to planning out products. The big cardboard factory I visited in Jiangmen was very impressive - huge and very modern/spacious. It is definitely the kind of place I could work - a lot of cool stuff going on, and most of the factory is air conditioned :)</p>",
